        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Nevada School of Law at Old College, Reno Gazette-Journal, Gannett Company, Nevada Appeal\n- Places: Reno, Nevada\n- Products: Las Vegas Review-Journal\n\nFacts:\n- After its first year, the Nevada School of Law at Old College moved from the former St. Thomas Aquinas Parochial School to its permanent home in the old Reno Gazette-Journal newspaper plant.\n- Gannett Company donated the old Reno Gazette-Journal newspaper plant to the Nevada School of Law at Old College.\n- The Reno Gazette-Journal is the main daily newspaper for Reno, Nevada.\n- Gannett Company owns the Reno Gazette-Journal.\n- Nevada Appeal is the third-largest newspaper in Nevada, behind the Las Vegas Review-Journal and the Reno Gazette-Journal.",
